# Local overrides for the Makefile. Copy to `.env`, then uncomment only the
# lines you want to change. `.env` is gitignored and must never be committed.
#
# Every line here is commented on purpose: the Makefile uses `?=`, which treats
# an empty `PORT=` as "already defined" and would pass an empty --port. Copying
# this file unchanged therefore changes nothing.
#
# This file is tracked (stripped at publish, not gitignored), so it names no
# port either — see the Makefile. Put the number you want in .env, which is
# gitignored and reaches nothing.

# Vite dev-server port. Leave unset to let Vite choose.
# PORT=

# Locales to switch on locally, as a comma list of codes from
# src/app/content/locales.json, or `all`. The site ships one locale, so there
# is nothing to switch on today; the override exists so that stays true in CI
# while a new locale is being worked on.
# IKISYSTEMS_LOCALES=
